  </verify>
  <acceptance_criteria>
    - `rg -n "pub enum Backing" crates/ontoforge-schema/src/ir/binding.rs` 有匹配；`rg -n "pub backing: Backing" crates/ontoforge-schema/src/ir/object.rs` 有匹配；`rg -n "pub backing: Option<Backing>" crates/ontoforge-schema/src/ir/link.rs` 有匹配
    - `rg -c "^backing: " examples/ontologies/aviation/objects.yaml` 输出 `5`，`rg -n "^backing: editOnly" examples/ontologies/aviation/objects.yaml` 恰好 1 行（Airport 文档内）
    - `rg -n '"backing"' schemas/ontoforge-definition.schema.json` 有匹配
    - `crates/ontoforge/tests/snapshots/invalid_examples__v05-missing-backing.snap` 与 `invalid_examples__v11-backing-on-one-to-many.snap` 存在，前者含 `ONT-V05`、后者含 `ONT-V11`
    - `rg -l 'missing required field `backing`' crates/ontoforge/tests/snapshots` 只列出 `invalid_examples__v05-missing-backing.snap`
    - `cargo test -p ontoforge-schema --test object_types --test link_types` 输出含 `test result: ok` 且 behavior 中的 6 个测试名都出现
  </acceptance_criteria>
  <done>backing 字段贯通 IR、校验、JSON Schema 与 CLI；Phase 1 全部 fixture 已迁移且快照语义零漂移；全工作区测试、clippy、fmt 全绿</done>
</task>

