  <name>Task 2: ADR-0021、ADR-0015 状态行与 REQUIREMENTS 文字对齐</name>
  <files>.planning/adr/0021-source-binding-files-and-backing.md, .planning/adr/0015-source-binding-and-type-contract.md, .planning/REQUIREMENTS.md</files>
